{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/SoC_gif_dlugi2.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a quiet wayside village you\u2019d pass by in a classic JRPG \u2013 you and your fluffy Spellbook Companion tend your farm, help the community, and explore dungeons filled with challenge and treasure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/The_World_Is_Healing.png?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twenty years after the Great Calamity, the land is finally recovering. As a young adventurer, you\u2019ll leave the bustling capital to settle in a quiet village on the frontier. Here, you\u2019ll build a cozy farm, help your neighbors, and uncover the small joys of life in a world healing from its past.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/night_rounded.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/Grow_You_Farm.png?t=1746436656\" />Tend crops, raise animals, and craft tools to grow your farm through the seasons! Help rebuild by sending resources to the capital and supporting your community. Celebrate the post-Calamity world with festivals, from harvest feasts to moonlit gatherings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/Chickens_rounded_corners.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/adventure-awaits_slime.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the village, dungeons brimming with monsters, treasures, and artifacts await discovery. With the help of your Spellbook Companion, battle slimes and bosses in accessible, turn-based combat. Gather rare resources to improve your farm and unlock new possibilities for growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/combat_rounded.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/SoC_steampage_napisy_zgifem333.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spellbook Companion is your constant ally, guiding you through your journey. This magical friend helps you uncover hidden treasures, catalog recipes and quests, and even casts spells in battle. It\u2019s more than a companion \u2013 it\u2019s an essential part of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/spellbookcompanion_rounded.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/Accessibility_Features.png?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeds of Calamity is designed with inclusivity in mind, featuring extensive accessibility options. Adjust controls, length of day, colors, difficulty, visuals, and more to ensure the game feels right for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into a world rebuilding from its past, one crop, friendship, and adventure at a time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1780070?t=1746436656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746436656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/5e9f8303ba7e336e3b5a7f56707a00505fa881cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746436656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/5e9f8303ba7e336e3b5a7f56707a00505fa881cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746436656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2811810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Laborious Lark \u2013 a solo developer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/Hello_Im_Jenny.png?t=1746436656\" />I'm the solo developer of Seeds of Calamity. I've always loved farming sims, and one day I thought, 'What the hell, I could make one too.' So I did! Seeds of Calamity is a peaceful, slow-paced game designed to fit your playstyle. From vibrant pixel-art visuals to a relaxing day-to-day rhythm, it offers a warm and welcoming experience. Whether you're exploring, farming, or helping out your neighbors, every moment is crafted with care.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/SoC_gif_dlugi2.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a quiet wayside village you\u2019d pass by in a classic JRPG \u2013 you and your fluffy Spellbook Companion tend your farm, help the community, and explore dungeons filled with challenge and treasure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/The_World_Is_Healing.png?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twenty years after the Great Calamity, the land is finally recovering. As a young adventurer, you\u2019ll leave the bustling capital to settle in a quiet village on the frontier. Here, you\u2019ll build a cozy farm, help your neighbors, and uncover the small joys of life in a world healing from its past.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/night_rounded.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/Grow_You_Farm.png?t=1746436656\" />Tend crops, raise animals, and craft tools to grow your farm through the seasons! Help rebuild by sending resources to the capital and supporting your community. Celebrate the post-Calamity world with festivals, from harvest feasts to moonlit gatherings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/Chickens_rounded_corners.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/adventure-awaits_slime.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the village, dungeons brimming with monsters, treasures, and artifacts await discovery. With the help of your Spellbook Companion, battle slimes and bosses in accessible, turn-based combat. Gather rare resources to improve your farm and unlock new possibilities for growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/combat_rounded.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/SoC_steampage_napisy_zgifem333.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spellbook Companion is your constant ally, guiding you through your journey. This magical friend helps you uncover hidden treasures, catalog recipes and quests, and even casts spells in battle. It\u2019s more than a companion \u2013 it\u2019s an essential part of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/spellbookcompanion_rounded.gif?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/extras/Accessibility_Features.png?t=1746436656\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeds of Calamity is designed with inclusivity in mind, featuring extensive accessibility options. Adjust controls, length of day, colors, difficulty, visuals, and more to ensure the game feels right for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into a world rebuilding from its past, one crop, friendship, and adventure at a time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Laborious Lark Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/header.jpg?t=1746436656","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256854295,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256854295/movie480.mp4?t=1733217262","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256854295/movie_max.mp4?t=1733217262"},"name":"Seeds of Calamity Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256854295/dac0cb51ec0319d88177200def3f1d1cda2b9c26/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1733217262","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256854295/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1733217262","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256854295/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1733217262"}}],"name":"Seeds of Calamity","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, Vista, 7, 8/8.1, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Pretty Soon","Doyoyo Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\r\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"12","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"true"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_590c6beb23bc3b3327fa4f62a8fa9f2b67796dba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746436656","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_590c6beb23bc3b3327fa4f62a8fa9f2b67796dba.600x338.jpg?t=1746436656"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_139113c37c205fbc22e762eac6760196b44ec94c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746436656","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_139113c37c205fbc22e762eac6760196b44ec94c.600x338.jpg?t=1746436656"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_dd8d11d177858b9e20a85bfa760c90ec74a7a0d2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746436656","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_dd8d11d177858b9e20a85bfa760c90ec74a7a0d2.600x338.jpg?t=1746436656"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_3837e20543ca48ac871e82359ca87cfd97856c62.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746436656","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_3837e20543ca48ac871e82359ca87cfd97856c62.600x338.jpg?t=1746436656"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_e6fc8fc12d58e5adadd11fbb5dc3c3a116581040.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746436656","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_e6fc8fc12d58e5adadd11fbb5dc3c3a116581040.600x338.jpg?t=1746436656"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1780070/ss_888ca